{
  "name": "key",
  "description": "Press and release keys.",
  "examples": [
    "  $ ffx emu input key a\n  $ ffx emu input key ctrl+alt+delete\n  $ ffx emu input key shift+f10 ret\n  $ ffx emu input key --down shift\n  $ ffx emu input key --up shift"
  ],
  "flags": [
    {
      "kind": "Switch",
      "optionality": "optional",
      "long": "--help",
      "short": null,
      "description": "display usage information",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "kind": {
        "Option": {
          "arg_name": "down"
        }
      },
      "optionality": "optional",
      "long": "--down",
      "short": null,
      "description": "press the keys of this combo without releasing them.",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "kind": {
        "Option": {
          "arg_name": "up"
        }
      },
      "optionality": "optional",
      "long": "--up",
      "short": null,
      "description": "release the keys of this combo, in reverse order, without pressing them.",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "kind": {
        "Option": {
          "arg_name": "key-duration"
        }
      },
      "optionality": "optional",
      "long": "--key-duration",
      "short": null,
      "description": "time in milliseconds between the last press and the first release of a combo. Defaults to 20.",
      "hidden": false
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Each combo is one or more QEMU QKeyCode names joined with '+'. Names are\ncase-sensitive and all lowercase, with no aliases: use `a`, not `A`, and `ret`\nfor the Enter/Return key. Common names:\n  a..z  0..9  ret  esc  spc  tab  backspace  delete  insert\n  shift  shift_r  ctrl  ctrl_r  alt  alt_r  meta_l  meta_r  menu\n  up  down  left  right  home  end  pgup  pgdn  caps_lock\n  f1..f24  kp_0..kp_9  kp_enter  minus  equal  comma  dot  slash\nAll names: https://www.qemu.org/docs/master/interop/qemu-qmp-ref.html#enum-QMP-ui.QKeyCode\n\nThe keys of a combo go down in the given order and come back up in reverse\norder. --down and --up send only the presses or only the releases. They can't\nbe combined with positional combos or with each other."
  ],
  "commands": [],
  "positionals": [
    {
      "name": "combos",
      "description": "key combos to press and release in turn, e.g. `a` or `ctrl+alt+delete`.",
      "optionality": "repeating",
      "hidden": false
    }
  ],
  "error_codes": []
}